ids around the  world never get to play their favorite  games in fact their Christmas wishes are  much more heartbreaking all we know  about this little boy is that he's nine  years old his Christmas letter was sent  to an organization that provides  presents for kids each Christmas the  little boy was asked to put only five  things he wished for Christmas but guess  what he only put in two and you won't  believe what they are his identity is  unknown to the public but his message  will break your heart his two Christmas  wishes included new shoes and a happier  life that's it it really does make you  wonder what he's going through and how  many children are going through the  exact same thing and no one knows about  it so next time you get upset if you  didn't get your wanted Christmas present  remember this sweet nine year old boy  who just wanted new shoes and a happier  life the heartbreaking letter was posted  on Facebook where hundreds of people  have reached out and volunteered to help  the boy have the best Christmas ever  Lewis Williams we hope you have your box  of tissues ready because this one is  going to make you cry  Lewis Williams is a nine-year-old boy  who has a shiny face and an adorable  smile but unlike most kids Lewis's life  wasn't exactly easy and he broke  everyone's heart with his Christmas wish  most children ask for multiple things  and some even count them to make sure  they got the right amount on Christmas  Day we're looking at you Dudley Dursley  on his birthday  luckily Lewis Williams is nothing like  Dudley in fact his Christmas wish is so  heartbreaking it will remind us how  lucky we are for the things we do have  in our lives  Lewis comes from a very poor family who  became homeless after his mom struggled  to pay rent despite working two jobs as  a trainee teacher and having her own  business the family moved 14 times his  mom's heart broke when she found out  Lewis's Christmas letter where he said  that all he wanted was a forever home  where he could play with Legos all day  in his letter he said he doesn't need  new toys instead II once a place for his  old toys in a forever home he also  mentions that everyone is sad living  where they are and he wants his family  to be happy again  we hope that Luis will get his wish as  quickly as possible  Luke Bedford sometimes kids might  surprise us with their Christmas wishes  in eight-year-old Luke's case his  Christmas wish wasn't even for himself  Luke's letter to Santa started off with  dear mrs. Claus and mr. Claus aka Santa  in his letter  Luke explains that he doesn't want  presents and that the only thing he  wants for Christmas is money for charity  it turns out that his best friend Thomas  told him about his cousin Orla who is  suffering from cancer he says that he's  not sure what it is but that he knows  it's very bad he ends the letter with  saying please please please give me no  presents for Christmas his touching  letter moved his mother and his friends  cousins mother to tears  - what's even more fascinating is the  fact that Luka never even met Orla in  the first place  we bet that this Christmas letter left  Santa in tears because it definitely  left us but we're not done yet stay  tuned to hear about a heartbreaking  letter that was tied to a balloon Phoebe  vine although Christmas is a very  traditional holiday it can be changed  every year as people get older you might  find yourself celebrating the holiday  differently and sometimes you might find  yourself missing the people you love the  most  the seven-year-old Phoebe vine had to  experience that in one of the hardest  ways possible at the age of seven she  our mother in a heartbreaking story her  mother passed away from a highly  aggressive brain tumor just a year  before Phoebe sent a Christmas letter to  Santa asking him not to let her mother  died a year later she sent another  letter which will be turned in an  impactful message her Christmas message  to her mother which says dear mummy I  miss you so much this Christmas love you  forever Phoebe will be displayed at  London Underground station throughout  the holidays Phoebe said that she misses  her mother and that she wants to make  her proud of her daughter we're pretty  sure her mother will be extra proud of  her seven-year-old daughter who was able  to make such an impact during Christmas  if you're spending your Christmas  without your loved ones this year we're  sending you big Internet hugs and a lot  of love Spencer every Christmas Jim  glove and Dylan Parker accidentally  received hundreds of Christmas letters  to their New York address the 22nd  Street in Manhattan their residents  became known as st. Nick's but nobody's  sure how that happened in the first  place and every single year the couple  takes their time and make sure they  reply to every single Christmas letter  the requests range from new technology  to many simple things like a new coat  for Mom  Spencer one of the kids whose  heartbreaking letters I've delivered to  22nd Street ask for new socks that will  keep his feet warm a couple of people  even got suspicious of the legitimacy of  Jim and Dillon story and one lady waited  patiently outside of their apartment  until she saw kids run to catch the  postman sounds like a story right from a  movie in fact it will get turned into a  movie called The Miracle on 22nd Street  while the living situations of kids like  Spencer don't get explained the  heartbreaking letters make the couple  cry and even though the two no longer  live at the address they continue to  make sure that every child receives a  response to their Christmas letter  unknown child if you've managed to leave  a dry eye all this time this story might  completely break you this Christmas  letter was found tied to a balloon and  nobody was able to track the child who  sent it it was found by a man who was  hoping to track him down in order to buy  him some  miss presents the reason in his 